<ContentLayout section="help" title="Returns and refunds" heading="Returns and refunds" lead="If something is wrong, we fix it. Here is exactly how." updated="5 October 2026">
  <p><strong>Draft:</strong> confirm this policy with legal advice before launch, especially the UK 14-day cancellation right (plan 09).</p>
  <h2>Faulty, damaged or misprinted</h2>
  <p>Email us within 30 days of delivery with your order number and a photo. We send a free replacement or a full refund, your choice. You do not need to send the item back.</p>
  <h2>Wrong size</h2>
  <p>Because each piece is printed for you, we cannot resell returned items. Check the <a href="/help/size-guide">size guide</a> before ordering. If it does not fit, contact us and we will help.</p>
  <h2>UK customers: your right to cancel</h2>
  <p>UK consumers can usually cancel an online order within 14 days of delivery. Contact us within that time and return the item unworn; we refund the item price within 14 days of getting it back.</p>
  <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
  <p>Refunds go back to the card you paid with. Banks usually show them within 5–10 working days.</p>
  <h2>Start a return</h2>
  <p><a href="/contact?topic=return">Contact us</a> with your order number.</p>
</ContentLayout>
